In a series connection, the reciprocals of the individual capacitances add up:

\[
\frac{1}{C_{\text{eq}}} = \frac{1}{5\,\mu\text{F}}+ \frac{1}{5\,\mu\text{F}}+ \frac{1}{5\,\mu\text{F}}+ \frac{1}{5\,\mu\text{F}}+ \frac{1}{5\,\mu\text{F}}
= \frac{5}{5\,\mu\text{F}} = \frac{1}{1\,\mu\text{F}}
\]

Thus the equivalent capacitance is

\[
C_{\text{eq}} = 1\,\mu\text{F}
\]

